From 42d3ca4cd47ba338ea94600b4364bbed28dcf9ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jingqi Chen <hobochen96@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:39:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add opt-in variable font and overlap rendering fixes for
 legacy macOS

Instance requested variation axes with HarfBuzz on systems before 10.13, preserving them through metrics, serialization and WebRender. Independently render raw glyph contours with nonzero fill before 10.10 to preserve overlapping strokes. Both paths are disabled by default and retain native drawing fallback for unsupported fonts.
